 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Grep now defaults to matching lines only and shows fewer matches per file; explicit context settings, limit notices, file pagination, and line-range recovery remain available.
+- Native wait now backs off immediately for a consecutive sole top-level call and distinguishes interactive turn-ending guidance from print/ACP waiting, without changing owned-job or owed-reply admission.
+- Preserve each conversation's workspace-tree prompt snapshot across resume/reload, refreshing automatic trees on new/cleared transcripts and cwd changes without replacing caller-supplied trees.
+- Todo accepts arrays and recovered task lists for done/drop/remove, preserving exact full task names and single-task start; empty arrays report an error instead of targeting the whole list.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Release departed eval runtime ownership after session transitions and rollback settle, preserving the adopted session's Python/JS runtimes and shared owners while retaining full-disposal behavior.
+
